Please note that DHLToolkit for Linux is not officially supported 


Run these commands in order to start use Linux for label generation
mv label.properties.linux label.properties
cd clientSoftware/SOPLabel/JasperReports; mv ArchiveLabel.jasper.linux ArchiveLabel.jasper; cd -

In order to generate the Shipment label correctly on Linux you would need to install Microsoft proprietary fonts. Common name of package for many distibutions is msttcorefonts .
Alternative is to manualy copy Arial and Arial Bold fonts to $JRE_HOME/lib/fonts

You need to amend SOPLabel/generateSOPLabel.sh to point to folder where jre is installed. 
This was tested on java build 1.6.0_29-b11
